prop messpad beh.use=Type the mess safe's code
prop messpad lock.code=4127
prop messpad on.use=sound||event:/exploring/obstacles/keypad/keypad_correct\nmessage||The keypad beeps and the mess safe's bolt slides back.\nsignal||messcode\ngive||story:messcode*1
prop messpad else.use=message||The safe wants the captain's code. Her log is on the mess table.
prop messsafe obj.name=messsafe
prop messsafe if.open=signal|messcode
prop messsafe else.open=message||The safe is locked. The keypad beside it wants a code.

quest title=Boarding the Whale
quest intro=A ship's bow on a ridge of ice. Climb the ramp to her side.
step reach|ramp|1|Climb the ice ramp to the Whale's side
step read|Iron Whale: crew roster|1|Read the crew roster by the gangway
step blueprint|Blueprint_WaterTank|1|Take the water tank's plans from the water plant
step read|Captain's log, day 1|1|Read the captain's log in the mess above
step open|Mess safe|1|Open the mess safe (the code is in the log)
step blueprint|Blueprint_ElectricPurifier|1|Take the electric purifier's plans from the galley
step read|Aerial lead, cut|1|The radio is dead. Find the aerial lead at the mast's foot
step reach|crane|1|Climb the mast and ride the zipline to the crane on the ice
step blueprint|Blueprint_Pipe_Water|1|Take the water pipe's plans from the crane box
